      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"ResourceReader.html#readFrom(org.springframework.core.io.Resource,java.lang.ClassLoader)\">readFrom</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"ResourceReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.init\">ResourceReader</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>resource</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - can be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> of target objects if resource contains multiple ones of single on. Never\n        null.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">IOException</a></code></dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"ResourceReader.html#readFrom(org.springframework.core.io.Resource,java.lang.ClassLoader)\">readFrom</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"ResourceReader.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.init 中的接口\">ResourceReader</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>resource</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - 可以为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果资源包含多个目标对象或单个目标对象，则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection</code></a>；永远不会为 null。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"java.io 中的类或接口\">IOException</a></code></dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
